# covers: ORDER BY, LIMIT and OFFSET, a top-n over every type
# quota: 400 records kept
# seeds: cases 0 to 53 of 0:2000
# tool commit: 98e672e
# references: PostgreSQL 17.11; DuckDB v2.0.0 (d54cbbe3df)
# normalization: by-value, decimal-exact, decimal-from-double, double-shortest-or-15, float-exact, text-exact, temporal-by-value, binary-bytes, special-floats, row-order
# records: 400 kept, 0 errors both references and the engine raise, 2 by design (decimal-result-type 2)

